JeevantaX – Digital Healthcare Management Platform
Full-stack project
AI-powered healthcare

GitHub Repository: JeevantaX_0.1

JeevantaX is an AI-powered digital healthcare platform that connects patients, doctors, and healthcare services through a single application.

Its main objective is to make healthcare more accessible by allowing patients to:
- Find doctors and book appointments.
- Upload medical reports.
- Check symptoms using AI.
- Store medical documents securely.
- Find nearby therapists.
- Receive healthcare reminders through Telegram.
Think of JeevantaX as a combination of an online doctor consultation platform, medical record management system, and AI healthcare assistant.
